  "netlist": "# Bazz Fuss - Mess o' Pedals breadboard build, moved to stripboard\n# 1u film input cap (the fuller-sounding option), 2N3904, 1N914.\n# The volume pot's wiper goes straight to the output jack tip, so it\n# never touches the board.\n#\n# D1 band (cathode, leg B) goes on the BASE. Backwards and there is no\n# sound at all - it is the fault almost every time.\n\nV+:     @+9V R1.A C3.A\nIN:     @IN C1.A\nGND:    @GND @VOL_3 Q1.E C3.B\n\nBASE:   Q1.B C1.B D1.B\nCOLL:   Q1.C R1.B D1.A C2.A\nVOL:    C2.B @VOL_1"
}
